<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Black Forest Guide: 11 places – High Road, Triberg, Gengenbach &amp; gorges – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Schwarzwaldhochstraße &amp; Mummelsee</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go early in the morning or on a weekday – on summer weekends the road is busy. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>8.20121,48.59652,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Hornisgrinde – highest peak of the northern Black Forest</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine it with the Mummelsee stop and plan two to three hours. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>8.20212,48.6057,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Titisee &amp; Feldberg</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Start at the Feldberg early and drive to Titisee in the afternoon – it is still bearable there then. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>8.18361,47.90143,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Baden-Baden</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Start in Baden-Baden and drive the High Road the next morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>8.24222,48.76312,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Triberg: cuckoo clocks &amp; Black Forest cake</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine waterfalls, clocks and cake in one day – everything is close together. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>8.22979,48.1292,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Gengenbach – half-timbered town</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · In December come early and enjoy the atmosphere; otherwise on a weekend, when everything is open. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>8.01531,48.40354,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Vogtsbauernhof Open-Air Museum (Gutach)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Plan it for a rainy day or a hot day – there is lots of shade and roofs. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>8.19718,48.272,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Triberg Waterfalls</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come early in the morning or late in the afternoon, then fewer people are there and the squirrels are more active. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>8.22765,48.12636,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Ravenna Gorge &amp; Viaduct</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go in the morning – then the path is empty and the sun shines into the valley. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>8.08024,47.91868,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Wutach Gorge – wilderness in the southern Black Forest</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Start early, take water and snacks and check closed sections beforehand. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>8.28347,47.86088,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Treetop Walk Bad Wildbad</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come in the morning and combine it with the High Road. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/black-forest/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>8.532,48.75027,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
